  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Audiveris/audiveris/tarball/5.11.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Audiveris/audiveris/zipball/5.11.0",
  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### User interface\r\n* Support for a user personal shape set in the shape board. Suggested by @manderpe\r\n* Support for a configurable table of keyboard shortcuts. Contributed by @galshacham\r\n\r\n### Engine\r\n* Added an L2 (Ridge) regularization to the implementation of the glyph classifier to prevent overfitting\r\n* Better handling of staff lines with very different thicknesses\r\n* Smarter staff line removal in case of crossing curves\r\n* User option to link dynamics to staff above or below. Contributed by [Pepper Pancoast](https://github.com/drtootsie)\r\n* Enable HiDPI scaling on Linux Wayland. Contributed by [Martin Wilck](https://github.com/mwilck)\r\n* Fix on window resizing issues. Contributed by [aha917](https://github.com/aha917)\r\n* Fix on parallel processing of multi-sheet books. Contributed by [Youngmin Yoo](https://github.com/recrack)\r\n* Fix on export of imperfect scans. Contributed by [Samit Mohnot](https://github.com/AnotherSamWithADream)\r\n* Fix on percussion/unknown clefs. Contributed by [tshidisoo](https://github.com/tshidisoo)\r\n* plus minor fixes\r\n\r\n### Project\r\n* The installers (for Windows, for Linux, for macOS) now include the Java modules jdk.localedata for locales other than the US locale (such as the FR locale) and jdk.accessibility for Assistive Technologies \r\n\r\n## Other works\r\n* Fix IndexOutOfBoundsException in MetronomeInter when equalIndex is 0 by @mgibson91 in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/894\r\n* Reword installation pages in the documentation for better clarity by @MaxwellBuchholz in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/842\r\n* feat: add manual movement start toggle on systems by @galshacham in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/922\r\n* Fix flatpak workflow for release event by @mwilck in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/929\r\n* RFC: Fix for issue #896: Enable HiDPI scaling on Linux Wayland by @mwilck in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/932\r\n* Audiveris Window Resizing Fix (Wayland/Tiling Window Managers) by @aha917 in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/948\r\n* Fix #893: NPE in KeyInter for percussion/unknown clefs by @tshidisoo in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/949\r\n* Fix two NPEs that abort batch -export OMR on imperfect scans by @AnotherSamWithADream in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/954\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @mgibson91 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/894\r\n* @MaxwellBuchholz made their first contribution in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/842\r\n* @galshacham made their first contribution in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/922\r\n* @aha917 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/948\r\n* @tshidisoo made their first contribution in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/949\r\n* @AnotherSamWithADream made their first contribution in https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/pull/954\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris/compare/5.10.2...refs/heads/master",
